    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual\">Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual</a></i> </p><p><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Celegians\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Celegians\">Celegians</a> rely on transplastseel life-support chambers to survive away from their homeworld. These chambers are filled with cyanogen gas and held aloft by the Celegian's natural levitation. A Celegian Life-Support Chamber possesses a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a> of 10. A <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Celegian\" title=\"Celegian\">Celegian</a> encased in a Celegian Life-Support Chamber receives a +5 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a>, as well as increasing their Fly Speed by +2 squares. </p>",
